    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S01_SH03",
      "speaker_id": "ZHAO_YU",
      "delivery": "off_screen_radio",
      "text": "烟里这个我来。周野，你跟着补。",
      "source_line": 25,
      "start_hint_s": 0.0,
      "end_hint_s": 3.8
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S01_SH04",
      "speaker_id": "CHEN_MO",
      "delivery": "off_screen_radio",
      "text": "我从跳台下来！",
      "source_line": 61,
      "start_hint_s": 0.0,
      "end_hint_s": 1.4
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S02_SH01",
      "speaker_id": "CHEN_MO",
      "delivery": "on_screen",
      "text": "先看一遍。",
      "source_line": 109,
      "start_hint_s": 0.0,
      "end_hint_s": 1.0
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S02_SH01",
      "speaker_id": "CHEN_MO",
      "delivery": "on_screen",
      "text": "不找替罪羊，只把当时听见的、看见的说清楚。",
      "source_line": 109,
      "start_hint_s": 1.2,
      "end_hint_s": 5.8
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S02_SH02",
      "speaker_id": "ZHOU_YE",
      "delivery": "on_screen",
      "text": "我听见后面还有脚步，但没报出来。",
      "source_line": 129,
      "start_hint_s": 0.0,
      "end_hint_s": 2.2
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S02_SH02",
      "speaker_id": "ZHOU_YE",
      "delivery": "on_screen",
      "text": "我怕他突然冲，就把准星挪开了。赵雨开枪时，我没能马上补上。",
      "source_line": 129,
      "start_hint_s": 2.5,
      "end_hint_s": 7.2
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S03_SH01",
      "speaker_id": "ZHAO_YU",
      "delivery": "recorded_replay",
      "text": "包边先别动，第二个脚步还没到。",
      "source_line": 161,
      "start_hint_s": 0.0,
      "end_hint_s": 3.4
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S04_SH01",
      "speaker_id": "SU_HE",
      "delivery": "on_screen",
      "text": "别碰他。",
      "source_line": 217,
      "start_hint_s": 0.0,
      "end_hint_s": 0.8
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S04_SH01",
      "speaker_id": "ZHOU_YE",
      "delivery": "on_screen",
      "text": "这是哪儿？",
      "source_line": 235,
      "start_hint_s": 1.8,
      "end_hint_s": 2.7
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S04_SH02",
      "speaker_id": "SU_HE",
      "delivery": "on_screen",
      "text": "曜京南城，白桥枪馆。",
      "source_line": 245,
      "start_hint_s": 0.0,
      "end_hint_s": 1.8
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S04_SH02",
      "speaker_id": "SU_HE",
      "delivery": "on_screen",
      "text": "你先别站。",
      "source_line": 245,
      "start_hint_s": 2.0,
      "end_hint_s": 3.0
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S04_SH03",
      "speaker_id": "XU_AN",
      "delivery": "on_screen",
      "text": "断帧前训练服是六比五。声音先走了半秒，比分跳成七比五，设备间镜头黑了一格。",
      "source_line": 333,
      "start_hint_s": 0.0,
      "end_hint_s": 5.8
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S04_SH04",
      "speaker_id": "ZHOU_YE",
      "delivery": "on_screen",
      "text": "给我一台机器。",
      "source_line": 417,
      "start_hint_s": 0.0,
      "end_hint_s": 1.5
    },
    {
      "shot_id": "S05_SH01",
      "speaker_id": "TANG_XIA",
      "delivery": "on_screen",
      "text": "给不给闪？",
